# Supabase migrations

When you add or edit files under `supabase/migrations/` (or ship app code that depends on new schema/RPCs):

1. Apply pending migrations to the linked database: `npm run supabase:migrate:apply`
2. If apply fails, fix the SQL or migration history before continuing feature work—do not leave code merged that assumes unapplied migrations.
3. Prefer this script over ad-hoc `supabase db push` unless deployment docs explicitly require CLI push for that environment.

After apply succeeds, re-run any affected tests or typecheck if types depend on the new schema.
